                "In ApexRevenueOS, post-sales customer retention is governed by the Predictive Churn Hazard & Health Telemetry Engine. Rather than relying on subjective customer sentiment or quarterly surveys, the system ingests continuous, multi-dimensional product usage telemetry: daily active users (DAU), feature adoption breadth, API query volume, license seat utilization fractions, and support ticket severity counts. These raw telemetry streams are normalized and processed through a mathematical decay curve that weights recent behavioral changes far more heavily than historical averages.",
